    {
      "id": "claim_64087282ac5d45e2aa403eefbd764671",
      "statement": "Caller-supplied subagents are partitioned by shape: entries with graph_id route to AsyncSubAgent/AsyncSubAgentMiddleware, entries with runnable are used as-is CompiledSubAgents, and the rest are declarative SubAgents each given their own resolved model, profile, middleware stack, permissions, and prompt overlay.",
